This distribution does not include a prebuilt Python environment. On first start, SoAI installs Python
dependencies listed in requirements.txt into its managed runtime environment. Those downloaded dependencies
are not included in this distribution and carry their own license terms.

On first start, SoAI may also download additional runtime artifacts, such as:
- Playwright Chromium (stored under data/state/playwright-browsers)
- Microsoft Build of OpenJDK for Apache Tika (stored under data/state/java)
- Apache Tika Server JAR (stored under data/state/tika)
- ripgrep binary for MCP grep_files (stored under data/state/ripgrep)
- tiktoken encoding tables published by OpenAI from Microsoft-operated storage at
  https://openaipublic.blob.core.windows.net, used for local token counting
  (stored under data/state/tiktoken-cache)

